<title>USA: Adaptive Solutions CEO resigns.</title>
<headline>Adaptive Solutions CEO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>BEAVERTON, Ore. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Adaptive Solutions Inc Tuesday said John Migliore has resigned as the company's president and chief executive officer due to &quot;a family tragedy.&quot;</p>
<p>In a statement, Dan Hammerstrom, the company founder and vice president of engineering, has been named acting president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Scott Gibson, chairman of the board, will be actively working with Hammerstrom in his interim role as well as leading the board of directors in its search for a permanent replacement, the company said.</p>
</text>
